}}'''Retro''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife obtainable from opening the [[2025 Summer Box]] during the [[Summer Event 2025]].

== Appearance ==
The blade has a funky, abstract pattern of geometric shapes in bright colors like yellow, pink, green, blue, and red. The guard is gold, and the grip is black.  

== Trivia ==

* It is a visual representation of 90s pop art.

